		{
			"id":"250bd9746c8d94fa",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Set the VAC Indicators on the [[031 - Utility Closet.canvas|031 - Utility Closet]] as instructed on the emails to show a hidden area on the room that will unlock the [[Gemstone Cavern.canvas|Gemstone Cavern]]",
